# Keeps the bytes UPSTREAM.sha256 and the sidecars name on a core.autocrlf=true checkout.
# These are lines 9, 11, 15 and 18 of USIM @3f9f42d .gitattributes ("BYTE-EXACT OR NOTHING").
# vendor/the-colour-qr/ keeps its own vendored .gitattributes.
*.hbp   text eol=lf
*.sha256 text eol=lf
*.png   -text binary
*.bin   -text binary
